# GPT-6.2 Astra — findings by Flint

- Source: OpenAI (`gpt-6.2-astra`)
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-6.2 Astra
- **Short description:** OpenAI's rumored next-generation frontier model, reportedly the third member of the GPT-6 family after the confirmed GPT-6 Astra (2026-09-29) and the shelved GPT-6.1 Astra — sighted only through unverified Codex usage-analytics labels and community reports as of 2026-11-13; no official announcement, release date, spec, pricing or benchmark has been published by OpenAI.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI — reported API model IDs `openai/gpt-6.2-astra` and `openai/gpt-6.2-sol`; Chat Completions / Responses API; status: unannounced (no official listing, no API changelog entry, no newsroom post).
- **Release / knowledge:** Not announced as of 2026-11-13 (OpenAI newsroom, API changelog and API models listings contain no GPT-6.2 content); knowledge cutoff not established.
- **IDs:** `openai/gpt-6.2-astra` (reported) / `openai/gpt-6.2-sol` (reported) — successor-family tier names following the confirmed `openai/gpt-6-astra` and `openai/gpt-6.1-sol` IDs; a rumored `Bel` variant was also referenced in third-party tracker screenshots (unverified).
- **Context window:** Not established — OpenAI published no GPT-6.2 context window; the prior GPT-6.1 Sol entry in OpenAI's API docs is documented at 1,050,000 tokens context.
- **Modalities:** Not established for GPT-6.2; prior family entries describe text + reasoning + tool use (GPT-6 Astra) and text reasoning (GPT-6.1 Sol).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** Not announced; prior entries: GPT-6 Astra API standard pricing $10/M input / $50/M output (Fast mode 2x), GPT-6.1 Sol $2/M input / $10/M output.
- **Architecture:** Not established; rumored next-generation frontier configuration reported at roughly 10–12 trillion parameters (unverified).

